1-4
Model: Recraft V3 Vector
Prompt:
A single cute cartoon soft-tip dart (the kind used on an electronic dartboard),
shown as a thrown dart flying away from you toward the board — seen from a
three-quarter angle, slightly behind and to the side, so its flight is nearest
the viewer and its slender tip points away into the distance (foreshortened, with
a strong sense of depth) while you still clearly see the side of the dart. It has
a slender pointed black plastic soft tip at the front, a short chunky metallic
barrel with a few subtle grip rings in the middle, a thin dark shaft, and a
bright playful flight of four small fins fanning out at the back. Bold clean
cartoon vector style with smooth rounded shapes, simple flat shading and a soft
highlight on the metal — the same friendly, endearing look as the ghosts. Plain
solid background, dart isolated and centered.


5-7:
Model: Recraft V3 Vector
Prompt:
A single cute cartoon soft-tip dart (the kind used on an electronic dartboard), flying roughly horizontally toward the board at a shallow angle — shown mostly from the side so its full length is clearly visible, with only a slight three-quarter tilt for a bit of depth. NOT diving steeply, not strongly foreshortened. It flies to the right: a slender pointed black plastic soft tip leads at the front (right), then a short chunky metallic barrel with a few subtle grip rings, a thin dark shaft, and a bright colourful flight of four small fins fanning out at the back (left). Bold clean cartoon vector style with smooth rounded shapes, simple flat shading and a soft highlight on the metal — a little more realistic and colourful than the ghosts. Plain solid background, dart isolated and centered.


